{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001","id":"msg_011CetWKqrLCYp8uXHJ7iQ3G","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"**Command run:** `./mvnw test` from sample-service/\n\n**Result:** BUILD SUCCESS\n- Tests run: 17\n- Failures: 0\n- Errors: 0\n- Skipped: 0\n\nThis includes 5 existing ShipmentControllerTest tests passing plus the 4 new ones I added (total 9 in ShipmentControllerTest).\n\n**Failures:** None\n\n**Fixes:** None needed — the implementation passed all tests on the first run.\n\n---\n\n<<PHASE:REVIEW>>\n\nLet me review the changes against the acceptance criteria and diff:\n\n**Acceptance criteria mapping:**\n\n1. ✅ **Existing build passes** — BUILD SUCCESS with 17 tests including all pre-existing tests (OrderControllerTest: 4, SampleServiceApplicationTests: 1, CustomerControllerTest: 3)\n\n2. ✅ **Existing tests pass** — All 5 original ShipmentControllerTest tests pass (creates, duplicates, getById, unknown, list)\n\n3. ✅ **POST /shipments/{shipmentId}/confirm confirms a created shipment and persists it** — Test \"confirms a created shipment to CONFIRMED status\" verifies CREATED→CONFIRMED transition and response body\n\n4. ✅ **Error responses are consistent with the rest of this API** — Uses ConflictException (409) for CANCELLED, ResourceNotFoundException (404) for unknown ID, both handled by GlobalExceptionHandler and formatted as ApiError envelope\n\n5. ✅ **A repeated confirm succeeds; a cancelled shipment is refused; an unknown id is refused** — Tests:\n   - \"confirm on already confirmed shipment succeeds without change\" (idempotent retry)\n   - \"confirm on cancelled shipment is rejected with 409\" (409 with SHIPMENT_INVALID_STATE)\n   - \"confirm on unknown shipment is rejected with 404\" (404 with SHIPMENT_NOT_FOUND)\n\n6. ✅ **No new Maven dependency appears** — Changed only .kt files, no pom.xml modified\n\n7. ✅ **No unrelated production file changes** — Only touched:\n   - ApiError.kt (added